---
const branch = [
	{ y: 248, label: 'Retrieval pipeline' },
	{ y: 276, label: 'Tools' },
	{ y: 304, label: 'Policy engine' },
	{ y: 332, label: 'Memory manager' },
	{ y: 360, label: 'Observability' },
];
const tools = [
	{ x: 490, label: 'GitHub' },
	{ x: 545, label: 'Postgres' },
	{ x: 600, label: 'Slack' },
];
---

<figure class="diagram">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 640 400" role="img" aria-labelledby="cp-title cp-desc">
		<title id="cp-title">RAG pipeline before and after a control plane</title>
		<desc id="cp-desc">
			Before: the app goes straight to a vector database and then the LLM. After: the app goes through a RAG control
			plane, where a RAG agent orchestrates a retrieval pipeline, tools, a policy engine, a memory manager and
			observability, and reaches GitHub, Postgres and Slack over MCP, before calling the LLM.
		</desc>

		<text class="row-label" x="0" y="18">Before</text>
		<path class="rail grey" d="M70 48 H570"></path>
		<circle class="stop grey" cx="70" cy="48" r="9"></circle>
		<circle class="stop grey" cx="320" cy="48" r="9"></circle>
		<circle class="stop grey" cx="570" cy="48" r="9"></circle>
		<text class="name" x="70" y="80" text-anchor="middle">App</text>
		<text class="name" x="320" y="80" text-anchor="middle">Vector DB</text>
		<text class="name" x="570" y="80" text-anchor="middle">LLM</text>

		<text class="row-label" x="0" y="132">After</text>
		<rect class="plane" x="180" y="150" width="280" height="236" rx="18"></rect>
		<text class="plane-label" x="196" y="172">RAG control plane</text>

		<path class="rail green" d="M70 200 H570"></path>
		<path class="rail blue" d="M320 218 V360"></path>
		<path class="rail coral" d="M320 276 H600"></path>

		<circle class="stop green big" cx="70" cy="200" r="10"></circle>
		<circle class="stop green big" cx="570" cy="200" r="10"></circle>
		<text class="name" x="70" y="236" text-anchor="middle">App</text>
		<text class="name" x="570" y="236" text-anchor="middle">LLM</text>

		{
			branch.map(({ y, label }) => (
				<>
					<circle class="stop blue" cx="320" cy={y} r="7" />
					<text class="name small" x="304" y={y + 4} text-anchor="end">
						{label}
					</text>
				</>
			))
		}

		<rect class="mcp" x="372" y="264" width="46" height="24" rx="12"></rect>
		<text class="mcp-label" x="395" y="280.5" text-anchor="middle">MCP</text>

		{
			tools.map(({ x, label }) => (
				<>
					<circle class="stop coral" cx={x} cy="276" r="7" />
					<text class="name small" x={x} y="302" text-anchor="middle">
						{label}
					</text>
				</>
			))
		}

		<rect class="agent" x="260" y="182" width="120" height="36" rx="18"></rect>
		<text class="agent-label" x="320" y="205" text-anchor="middle">RAG agent</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		Same boxes, same arrows. The work moves into the agent in the middle, which reaches tools over MCP and runs inside a
		control plane that keeps it observable.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.diagram {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-l);
		background: var(--white);
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--rule);
	}

	svg {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
	}

	.row-label {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 15px;
		font-weight: 750;
		fill: var(--quiet);
	}

	.rail {
		fill: none;
		stroke-linecap: round;
	}

	.rail.grey {
		stroke: var(--rule-strong);
		stroke-width: 8;
	}

	.rail.green {
		stroke: var(--line-ae);
		stroke-width: 10;
	}

	.rail.blue {
		stroke: var(--line-sa);
		stroke-width: 8;
	}

	.rail.coral {
		stroke: var(--line-hs);
		stroke-width: 6;
	}

	.stop {
		fill: var(--white);
		stroke-width: 4;
	}

	.stop.big {
		stroke-width: 5;
	}

	.stop.grey {
		stroke: #9aa3b2;
	}

	.stop.green {
		stroke: var(--line-ae);
	}

	.stop.blue {
		stroke: var(--line-sa);
		stroke-width: 3.5;
	}

	.stop.coral {
		stroke: var(--line-hs);
		stroke-width: 3.5;
	}

	.name {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		fill: var(--ink);
	}

	.name.small {
		font-size: 12.5px;
	}

	.plane {
		fill: #f1f5ff;
		stroke: var(--line-sa);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
		stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
	}

	.plane-label {
		font-size: 12.5px;
		font-weight: 700;
		fill: #1f4fd1;
	}

	.agent {
		fill: var(--white);
		stroke: var(--ink);
		stroke-width: 3.5;
	}

	.agent-label {
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 700;
		fill: var(--ink);
	}

	.mcp {
		fill: #ffe8ec;
		stroke: var(--line-hs);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}

	.mcp-label {
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 800;
		fill: #c81e45;
	}

	figcaption {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--t-small);
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--quiet);
	}
</style>
